  accTitle: Five residual bundles and one closed case
  accDescr: Five residual bundles remain open as research hypotheses: B1 memory value and latency, B2 typed recovery, B3 workspace competition and broadcast, B4 persistent intention and method authority, and B6 uncertainty and resource control. B5 is separated because GraSP already composes the mapped skill-governance chain in the reviewed corpus.
