    direction TB
    B1[B1 Memory value and latency]
    B2[B2 Typed recovery]
    B3[B3 Workspace competition]
    B4[B4 Intention and method authority]
    B6[B6 Uncertainty and resources]
  end
  subgraph CLOSED[Closed candidate]
    direction TB
    B5[B5 Skill governance]
    G[GraSP existing chain]
    B5 --> G
  end
  OPEN --> Q[Composition remains to be tested]
  G --> BASE[Mandatory skill-governance baseline]
